 romance partner judy is  only attracted to characters with  feminine bodies and voices so keep  that in mind you'll also either need to  buck maiko's plan and return control of  the class to the dolls or assist mico  and resist her payment at the end of the  mission  pyramid song also gives you your chance  to romance judy while unlocking her  apartment as a safe house  for your use from there on out everyone  in this city lives in their own goddamn  bubble  and either you fly high or sink into  quicksand  next up is pan ams questline once you  complete ghost town and life during  wartime in the main story quest you'll  eventually get a call from pan am  asking for additional help you'll need  to rescue a nomad from a raf and  scavenger camp for the first mission  then help pan am with a heist  make sure you side with pan am and any  arguments about what the right course of  action is or you might end the quest  line  early if you stay on pan am side you can  eventually unlock the opportunity to  start a romance with her although she's  only attracted to characters with  masculine body and voice types  if you want to complete pan am's romance  quest be sure to flirt with her during  riders on the storm by recommending she  remove her shoes and don't tip off saul  to her plan in with a little help from  my friends  you should also avoid suggesting that  you're helping pan am for monetary  reasons  you'll also get your chance to  consummate the relationship in queen of  the highway while also  opening up a safe house in the aldo  caldo camp for your use  completing pan am's relationship quest  even if you don't choose to romance her  can  also have an effect on the ending you  get without my clan who am i  what would i become if i stayed in night  city next up is rivers questline  to kick off rivers series of character  quests you'll need to complete ghost  town and life during wartime and also  raise your street cred specifically in  haywood  city center or westbrook you'll soon get  a call from elizabeth perales which will  give you the opportunity to take on a  side job i fought the law  taking on the quest will put you in  contact with river another major side  character and possible romance partner  after completing i fought the law you'll  eventually receive another call from  river asking for your help on another  job  you'll need to help him on his  investigation into an accused kidnapper  known as peter pan  the goal of the mission is to track down  randy river's nephew which takes you on  a multi-step quest to gather information  the primary piece of info you're trying  to track down is peter pan's hideout  you can do this just by putting together  clues or by tracking down randy's  computer if your intelligence attribute  is high enough  if you find the right clues river will  take you to the correct farm  straight away if not you'll have to  guess picking the wrong farm however can  lock you out of river's romance option  if you have to guess the correct farm is  edgewood the final mission in river's  quest gives you the chance to solidify  the romance but he'll only be attracted  to you if you've got a female body type  and if you've managed to save randy's  life  the last mission is just story and  conversations but allow you to complete  rivers storyline  relax just got one question to ask you  and now we're on to johnny's questline  you'll unlock his first quest chipping  in once you've completed  four major branches of story missions  automatic love with judy  life during war time with pan am  transmission with the voodoo boys and  search and destroy with takamura the  conversations with johnny that take  place after  those missions compose tapeworm a side  quest that opens up a number of missions  related to johnny's life  chipping in is the beginning of johnny's  questline so you'll want to knock that  one out for sure  head to the afterlife to kick it off and  allow johnny to take control while  you're there